# QA: with keyboard/gamepad the Track select options (laps, rivals, weather, time, Reverse, Mirror …)
# are only reachable for the tracks in the last column: focusing a card selects it, and the panel is
# only the `right` neighbour of the last column. Tries to configure Toy Town (run with --unlock-all
# so Reverse is unlocked).
wait ui
3.5 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title
1.5 nav keyboardA down             # Quick Race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
2.0 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA left             # Toy Town selected
0.8 shot tsr_01_toy_town_selected
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # → Sofa Circuit (now selected)
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # → Backyard Bash (now selected)
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # → options … of Backyard Bash
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Layout → Reverse
0.8 shot tsr_02_options_reached_for_backyard
0.3 nav keyboardA left             # leave the panel: back on the cards …
0.8 shot tsr_03_left_from_options
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # options panel has no up/down exit either
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.8 shot tsr_04_bottom_of_panel
1.0 exit
